    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for that. Could you go into a bit more detail regarding the wear and tear specifically? I'm worried about things like scuff marks from heavy foot traffic or small surface abrasions over time. Which of these three would be the most resilient against those kinds of daily micro-damages?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
